//! tr kodlu 1
// Error 06 — Changing a constant.
// Message code: H1002
// What happens: The type checker catches, before the program runs, that a constant is assigned a second time.
// Why: A const is assigned once and never changes.
// Fixed version:
//     var vat = 18
//     vat = 20 // use a variable, not a constant, if it has to change
// Run (from the project root): tr examples/en/errors/06_changing_a_constant.tr   (exit code 1)

A031 VAT = 18
VAT = 20
G100(VAT)
